# The author 2026-11-18 (journal section 19): the interpreter does not scan the body of a call at its entry. A free name is resolved at its first
# read, so a name with no source in a branch that is not taken refuses nothing: seen is 5 and after is 6.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: after 0
)
sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    int: t 0
    shared\Observed\seen := 5
    if: t = 1
        t := nosuch(1)
    shared\Observed\after := 6
main()
